{"2542850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Book of Infinity: 1001 Nights", "steam_appid": 2542850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Find us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7c590b3571f8f80a976201c12bb95ed7.avif?t=1788240008\" width=762 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X </strong>@AdaEden1001 | <strong>Tiktok &amp; IG</strong> @1001nights.ai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>Discord</strong> through the right sidebar!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f38f41ac248722855f950693afd0ceb.avif?t=1788240008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras_big/4f38f41ac248722855f950693afd0ceb.avif?t=1788240008 width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where the power of stories shapes reality, driven by unique intelligent narrative system...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapted from Persian folklore: The brutal and bloodthirsty King Shahryar, consumed by rage after his wife's betrayal, takes a new bride each day only to cruelly execute her at dawn. You are Scheherazade, his next victim...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you end his reign of terror by literally telling stories? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/c2bd3170752aebdc186a103b36f3c9b1.avif?t=1788240008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras_big/c2bd3170752aebdc186a103b36f3c9b1.avif?t=1788240008 width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/d5bd76dbe437dfb3903d68104e9eb186.poster.avif?t=1788240008\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/d5bd76dbe437dfb3903d68104e9eb186.webm?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/d5bd76dbe437dfb3903d68104e9eb186.mp4?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by Wittgenstein's notion: &quot;The limits of my language mean the limits of my world.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination! Tell captivating tales to intrigue the merciless King through typing. Cleverly guide him to mention words like 'sword', 'knife', or 'shield' in his responses - watch as they magically materialize into real weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life by our unique intelligent narrative system, each story is a one-of-a-kind creation - completely unscripted! But beware... strange words might provoke the King's deadly wrath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/093c4eda13e472d4e0fe52f65f535130.avif?t=1788240008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras_big/093c4eda13e472d4e0fe52f65f535130.avif?t=1788240008 width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f231dc40e5df042fc7af89e74b33ae8.poster.avif?t=1788240008\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f231dc40e5df042fc7af89e74b33ae8.webm?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f231dc40e5df042fc7af89e74b33ae8.mp4?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect weapons forged from your stories! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generated in real-time based on your narratives! From shawarma kitchen knives to witch's spears... every weapon is one of a kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7487dbd548166887e04aefc0ec8facf8.avif?t=1788240008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras_big/7487dbd548166887e04aefc0ec8facf8.avif?t=1788240008 width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/fbee6bd1eb0bbfd1c3d82c4150fd326f.poster.avif?t=1788240008\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/fbee6bd1eb0bbfd1c3d82c4150fd326f.webm?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/fbee6bd1eb0bbfd1c3d82c4150fd326f.mp4?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle the King in a world born from your tales! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is an unprecedented theatrical performance - weapon effects and even character dialogues spring from the stories you've crafted!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Crafting Game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by innovative storytelling mechanics as the core gameplay. This unique experience combines creative writing with strategic gameplay. Award-winning design ensures every story is unique!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Aesthetics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features distinctive pixel art and hand-drawn illustrations! All artwork is lovingly created by human artists to bring your stories to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Traditional Norms:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from ancient patriarchal constraints with Scheherazade!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academic Foundation:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a game - it's an academic and artistic project. We've published two papers on the game's systems, hoping to inspire more novel games!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f38f41ac248722855f950693afd0ceb.avif?t=1788240008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras_big/4f38f41ac248722855f950693afd0ceb.avif?t=1788240008 width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where the power of stories shapes reality, driven by unique intelligent narrative system...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapted from Persian folklore: The brutal and bloodthirsty King Shahryar, consumed by rage after his wife's betrayal, takes a new bride each day only to cruelly execute her at dawn. You are Scheherazade, his next victim...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you end his reign of terror by literally telling stories? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/c2bd3170752aebdc186a103b36f3c9b1.avif?t=1788240008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras_big/c2bd3170752aebdc186a103b36f3c9b1.avif?t=1788240008 width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/d5bd76dbe437dfb3903d68104e9eb186.poster.avif?t=1788240008\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/d5bd76dbe437dfb3903d68104e9eb186.webm?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/d5bd76dbe437dfb3903d68104e9eb186.mp4?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by Wittgenstein's notion: &quot;The limits of my language mean the limits of my world.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination! Tell captivating tales to intrigue the merciless King through typing. Cleverly guide him to mention words like 'sword', 'knife', or 'shield' in his responses - watch as they magically materialize into real weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life by our unique intelligent narrative system, each story is a one-of-a-kind creation - completely unscripted! But beware... strange words might provoke the King's deadly wrath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/093c4eda13e472d4e0fe52f65f535130.avif?t=1788240008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/e