e6bd1eb0bbfd1c3d82c4150fd326f.mp4?t=1788240008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle the King in a world born from your tales! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is an unprecedented theatrical performance - weapon effects and even character dialogues spring from the stories you've crafted!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Crafting Game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by innovative storytelling mechanics as the core gameplay. This unique experience combines creative writing with strategic gameplay. Award-winning design ensures every story is unique!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Aesthetics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features distinctive pixel art and hand-drawn illustrations! All artwork is lovingly created by human artists to bring your stories to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Traditional Norms:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from ancient patriarchal constraints with Scheherazade!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academic Foundation:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a game - it's an academic and artistic project. We've published two papers on the game's systems, hoping to inspire more novel games!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Can you survive an evil King who kills a bride every night by telling stories? A story-crafting game based on a unique narrative system — Become the storyteller Scheherazade from Persian folklore, weave tales to the King through typing, and guide his words to forge magical weapons for your revenge!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“The concept is so great, I was amazed of how well it worked! That games power is endless.”<br>AMaze Award<br><br>“Presents a unique and groundbreakin